#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:4
msgid "Python 3.9"
msgstr "Python 3.9"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:6
msgid ""
"Python 3.9.0 (final) was released on the 5th October 2020. The Features for "
"3.9 are defined in `PEP 596 "
"<https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0596/#features-for-3-9>`_ and a "
"detailed description of the changes can be found in `What's New in Python "
"3.9 <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"Python 3.9.0（正式版）於 2020 年 10 月 5 日發布。3.9 的功能定義於 `PEP 596 "
"<https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0596/#features-for-3-9>`_\\ ，變更的詳細說明可在 "
"`What's New in Python 3.9 <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html>`_ "
"中找到"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:15
msgid "**Features**"
msgstr "**功能**"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:15
msgid "**Status**"
msgstr "**狀態**"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:17
msgid "`PEP 573 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0573/>`_"
msgstr "`PEP 573 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0573/>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:17
msgid "Fast access to module state from methods of C extension types"
msgstr "從 C 擴充型別的方法快速存取模組狀態"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:17 ../../differences/python_39.rst:26
#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:36
msgid "Not relevant"
msgstr "不相關"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:20
msgid "`PEP 584 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0584/>`_"
msgstr "`PEP 584 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0584/>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:20
msgid "Union operators added to dict"
msgstr "為 dict 新增聯集運算子"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:20
msgid "Complete [#pep584]_"
msgstr "已完成 [#pep584]_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:22
msgid "`PEP 585 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0584/>`_"
msgstr "`PEP 585 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0584/>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:22
msgid "Type hinting generics in standard collections"
msgstr "標準集合中的型別提示泛型"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:24
msgid "`PEP 593 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0593/>`_"
msgstr "`PEP 593 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0593/>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:24
msgid "Flexible function and variable annotations"
msgstr "彈性的函式與變數註解"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:26
msgid "`PEP 602 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0602/>`_"
msgstr "`PEP 602 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0602/>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:26
msgid ""
"CPython adopts an annual release cycle. Instead of annual, aiming for two "
"month release cycle"
msgstr "CPython 採用年度發布週期。並非以年度為目標，而是以兩個月的發布週期為目標"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:29
msgid "`PEP 614 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0614/>`_"
msgstr "`PEP 614 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0614/>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:29
msgid "Relaxed grammar restrictions on decorators"
msgstr "放寬對裝飾器的文法限制"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:31
msgid "`PEP 615 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0615/>`_"
msgstr "`PEP 615 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0615/>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:31
msgid ""
"The IANA Time Zone Database is now present in the standard library in the "
"zoneinfo module"
msgstr "IANA 時區資料庫現在以 zoneinfo 模組形式存在於標準函式庫中"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:34
msgid "`PEP 616 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0616/>`_"
msgstr "`PEP 616 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0616/>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:34
msgid "String methods to remove prefixes and suffixes"
msgstr "用於移除前綴與後綴的字串方法"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:36
msgid "`PEP 617 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0617/>`_"
msgstr "`PEP 617 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0617/>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:36
msgid "CPython now uses a new parser based on PEG"
msgstr "CPython 現在使用基於 PEG 的新剖析器"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:39
msgid "Other Language Changes:"
msgstr "其他語言變更："

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:45
msgid "*__import__()* now raises *ImportError* instead of *ValueError*"
msgstr "*__import__()* 現在會引發 *ImportError* 而非 *ValueError*"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:45 ../../differences/python_39.rst:114
#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:116
msgid "Complete"
msgstr "已完成"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:47
msgid ""
"Python now gets the absolute path of the script filename specified on the "
"command line (ex: *python3* *script.py*): the *__file__* attribute of the "
"*__main__* module became an absolute path, rather than a relative path"
msgstr ""
"Python 現在會取得命令列上所指定指令碼檔名的絕對路徑（例如：\\ *python3* *script.py*\\ ）：\\ *__main__* "
"模組的 *__file__* 屬性從相對路徑變成了絕對路徑"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:51
msgid ""
"By default, for best performance, the errors argument is only checked at the"
" first encoding/decoding error and the encoding argument is sometimes "
"ignored for empty strings"
msgstr "預設情況下，為了獲得最佳效能，errors 引數只在第一次編碼／解碼錯誤時才會檢查，且 encoding 引數對於空字串有時會被忽略"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:54
msgid ""
"*\"\".replace(\"\", s, n)* now returns *s* instead of an empty string for "
"all non-zero n. It is now consistent with *\"\".replace(\"\", s)*"
msgstr "對於所有非零的 n，\\ *\"\".replace(\"\", s, n)* 現在會傳回 *s* 而非空字串。它現在與 *\"\".replace(\"\", s)* 一致"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:57
msgid ""
"Any valid expression can now be used as a decorator. Previously, the grammar"
" was much more restrictive"
msgstr "現在任何有效的運算式都可作為裝飾器。先前的文法限制嚴格得多"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:59
msgid ""
"Parallel running of *aclose()* / *asend()* / *athrow()* is now prohibited, "
"and *ag_running* now reflects the actual running status of the async "
"generator"
msgstr ""
"現在禁止平行執行 *aclose()* / *asend()* / *athrow()*\\ ，且 *ag_running* "
"現在反映非同步產生器的實際執行狀態"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:62
msgid ""
"Unexpected errors in calling the *__iter__* method are no longer masked by "
"TypeError in the in operator and functions contains(), indexOf() and "
"countOf() of the operator module"
msgstr ""
"呼叫 *__iter__* 方法時的非預期錯誤，不再被 in 運算子以及 operator 模組的 contains()、indexOf() 與 "
"countOf() 函式中的 TypeError 所遮蔽"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:65
msgid ""
"Unparenthesized lambda expressions can no longer be the expression part in "
"an if clause in comprehensions and generator expressions"
msgstr "在生成式與產生器運算式中，未加括號的 lambda 運算式不再能作為 if 子句的運算式部分"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:69
msgid "Changes to built-in modules:"
msgstr "內建模組的變更："

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:75
msgid "`asyncio <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#asyncio>`_"
msgstr "`asyncio <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#asyncio>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:77
msgid ""
"Due to significant security concerns, the reuse_address parameter of "
"*asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint()* is no longer supported"
msgstr ""
"由於重大的安全疑慮，\\ *asyncio.loop.create_datagram_endpoint()* 的 reuse_address "
"參數不再受支援"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:80
msgid ""
"Added a new coroutine *shutdown_default_executor()* that schedules a "
"shutdown for the default executor that waits on the *ThreadPoolExecutor* to "
"finish closing. Also, *asyncio.run()* has been updated to use the new "
"coroutine."
msgstr ""
"新增了一個新協程 *shutdown_default_executor()*\\ ，它會排程關閉預設執行器，並等待 "
"*ThreadPoolExecutor* 完成關閉。此外，\\ *asyncio.run()* 也已更新為使用此新協程。"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:84
msgid ""
"Added *asyncio.PidfdChildWatcher*, a Linux-specific child watcher "
"implementation that polls process file descriptors"
msgstr "新增了 *asyncio.PidfdChildWatcher*\\ ，這是一個 Linux 特定的子行程監看器實作，會輪詢行程的檔案描述符"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:87
msgid "added a new *coroutine asyncio.to_thread()*"
msgstr "新增了一個新的 *coroutine asyncio.to_thread()*"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:89
msgid ""
"When cancelling the task due to a timeout, *asyncio.wait_for()* will now "
"wait until the cancellation is complete also in the case when timeout is <= "
"0, like it does with positive timeouts"
msgstr ""
"當因逾時而取消任務時，\\ *asyncio.wait_for()* 現在即使在逾時 <= 0 的情況下也會等待取消完成，就如同正值逾時時的行為一樣"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:92
msgid ""
"*asyncio* now raises *TyperError* when calling incompatible methods with an "
"*ssl.SSLSocket* socket"
msgstr "當以 *ssl.SSLSocket* socket 呼叫不相容的方法時，\\ *asyncio* 現在會引發 *TyperError*"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:94
msgid "`gc <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#gc>`_"
msgstr "`gc <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#gc>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:96
msgid "Garbage collection does not block on resurrected objects"
msgstr "垃圾回收不會在復活的物件上阻塞"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:98
msgid ""
"Added a new function *gc.is_finalized()* to check if an object has been "
"finalized by the garbage collector"
msgstr "新增了一個新函式 *gc.is_finalized()*\\ ，用來檢查某物件是否已被垃圾回收器終結"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:100
msgid "`math <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#math>`_"
msgstr "`math <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#math>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:102
msgid ""
"Expanded the *math.gcd()* function to handle multiple arguments. Formerly, "
"it only supported two arguments"
msgstr "擴充了 *math.gcd()* 函式以處理多個引數。先前它只支援兩個引數"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:104
msgid ""
"Added *math.lcm()*: return the least common multiple of specified arguments"
msgstr "新增 *math.lcm()*\\ ：傳回所指定引數的最小公倍數"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:106
msgid ""
"Added *math.nextafter()*: return the next floating-point value after x "
"towards y"
msgstr "新增 *math.nextafter()*\\ ：傳回 x 朝向 y 之後的下一個浮點數值"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:108
msgid ""
"Added *math.ulp()*: return the value of the least significant bit of a float"
msgstr "新增 *math.ulp()*\\ ：傳回浮點數最低有效位元的值"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:110
msgid "`os <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#os>`_"
msgstr "`os <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#os>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:112
msgid "Exposed the Linux-specific *os.pidfd_open()* and *os.P_PIDFD*"
msgstr "公開了 Linux 特定的 *os.pidfd_open()* 與 *os.P_PIDFD*"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:114
msgid "The *os.unsetenv()* function is now also available on Windows"
msgstr "*os.unsetenv()* 函式現在於 Windows 上也可用"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:116
msgid ""
"The *os.putenv()* and *os.unsetenv()* functions are now always available"
msgstr "*os.putenv()* 與 *os.unsetenv()* 函式現在一律可用"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:118
msgid ""
"Added *os.waitstatus_to_exitcode()* function: convert a wait status to an "
"exit code"
msgstr "新增 *os.waitstatus_to_exitcode()* 函式：將 wait 狀態轉換為退出碼"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:120
msgid "`random <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#random>`_"
msgstr "`random <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#random>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:122
msgid "Added a new *random.Random.randbytes* method: generate random bytes"
msgstr "新增了一個新的 *random.Random.randbytes* 方法：產生隨機位元組"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:124
msgid "`sys <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#sys>`_"
msgstr "`sys <https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.9.html#sys>`_"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:126
msgid ""
"Added a new *sys.platlibdir* attribute: name of the platform-specific "
"library directory"
msgstr "新增了一個新的 *sys.platlibdir* 屬性：平台特定函式庫目錄的名稱"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:128
msgid ""
"Previously, *sys.stderr* was block-buffered when non-interactive. Now stderr"
" defaults to always being line-buffered"
msgstr "先前，\\ *sys.stderr* 在非互動式時為區塊緩衝。現在 stderr 預設一律為行緩衝"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:133
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "註解"

#: ../../differences/python_39.rst:134
msgid ""
"PEP 584 ``dict`` union operator is only available on MicroPython builds with"
" ``MICROPY_CPYTHON_COMPAT`` enabled."
msgstr ""
"PEP 584 的 ``dict`` 聯集運算子僅在啟用 ``MICROPY_CPYTHON_COMPAT`` 的 MicroPython 建置中可用。"
